Vnum            10001
Name            stormwind guard~
ShortDesc       暴風城守衛~
LongDesc        一名暴風城守衛(stormwind guard)正在巡邏。
~
Description
身著精良聯盟盔甲的精銳守衛﹐負責保衛暴風城的安全。眼神銳利
﹐對任何可疑人物都保持高度警戒。
~
Sentinel        Yes
StayArea        Yes
AutoSetValue    Yes
Effect          'detect invis'
Effect          'detect hidden'
Effect          'sanctuary'
Alignment       200
Level           30
Hitroll         0
Protect         -1
Damroll         0
Str             -1
Int             -1
Wis             -1
Dex             -1
Con             -1
Hp              -1
Mana            -1
Move            -1
Class           CLASS_FIGHTER
Gold            -1
Multipile       100
AttackRatio     100
DodgeRatio      100
Migrate         0
Sex             SEX_MALE

Process
Type            fight_prog
Chance          100
Text
if isnpc($n)
  break
endif
if isimmort($n)
  break
endif
if isenemy($n) != '暴風城'
  mpsetenemy $n '暴風城'
endif
~
End

Process
Type            rand_prog
Chance          30
Text
if rand(30)
  emote 巡邏著街道…
  say 保持秩序！違法者將被逮捕！
endif
~
End

End